# E-SUKET — Project Context

**E-SUKET** adalah sistem pengelolaan surat keterangan Pemerintah Kota Kediri (Laravel 11, PHP 8.2+).

## Stack

- **Backend:** Laravel 11, Sanctum, DomPDF, PHPWord, Yajra DataTables, Activity Log
- **Frontend:** Blade + **Bootstrap 5.3** (SCSS via Vite), bukan Tailwind aktif
- **Build:** `npm run dev` / `npm run build` — entry: `resources/sass/app.scss`, `resources/js/app.js`
- **JS:** jQuery, Select2 (bootstrap-5 theme), SweetAlert2, Toastify, Axios
- **Icons:** Remix Icon (`ri-*`) — jangan pakai Font Awesome / Bootstrap Icons

## Struktur View

| Layout | Pemakaian |
|--------|-----------|
| `layouts/main` | Dashboard petugas/admin (sidebar + topbar) |
| `layouts/warga` | Portal warga beranda |
| `layouts/page` | Daftar surat warga |
| `layouts/create` | Form buat/edit surat |
| `layouts/landing` | Login |
| `layouts/home` | Landing publik |

- Komponen reusable: `resources/views/components/`
- Action buttons per role: `resources/views/includes/button-*.blade.php`
- Page assets: `@push('styles')` / `@push('scripts')` / `@stack`

## Konvensi Kode

- Controller di `app/Http/Controllers/`, model per jenis surat (`Skboro`, `Sktm`, dll.)
- Jangan hardcode warna lama (`#AEA07A`, `#AB9C71`, `#7896B2`) — gunakan token CSS di `_theme.scss`
- Mobile: selalu sertakan `mobile-responsive-pro.css` di layout (sudah ada di layout utama)
- Form: Bootstrap grid (`row`/`col-md-*`) atau floating input `.fi` / `.fi--a` / `.fi--s`
- Workflow surat: komponen `btnproses`, `btntolak`, `btncetak` + trait `HasUiStatus`

## File Penting

- Tema: `resources/sass/_theme.scss`, `_variables.scss`, `_sidebar.scss`
- Layout: `resources/views/layouts/*.blade.php`
- Mobile: `public/css/mobile-responsive-pro.css`
